<title>NETHERLANDS: Generale raises Ahold 1997, 1998 EPS.</title>
<headline>Generale raises Ahold 1997, 1998 EPS.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of March 10 research.</p>
<p>    Company---------Sector--------Price---Broker----------------</p>
<p>    Ahold	     Retail	  139.10  Gen. Oyens Van Eeghen</p>
<p>COMMENT: Ahold has had good start to 1997, expects net to be</p>
<p>considerably higher than in 1996 with EPS up significantly.</p>
<p>Higher dollar also in its favour. We maintain buy opinion.</p>
<p>    Estimates (NLG):  EPS     pvs EPS   P/E    Dividend</p>
<p>    1996 (actual)     4.30    ----	32.3   NLG0.96 + $0.43</p>
<p>    1997		  5.15    5.05	27.0</p>
<p>    1998		  5.80    5.75	24.0</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000 (Fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
</text>
